@startuml i4-tls-edge-topology
' I4 S3 / E27 — TLS edge (docs/hld/71-i4-wave4.md §71.4, D32).
' Browsers grant the microphone only in a secure context: a trainee PC opening
' http://<server-LAN-IP> gets no microphone. One TLS endpoint fixes UI, API, WS and LiveKit signalling.

title TLS edge — Caddy on 443 in front of frontend, API, WS and LiveKit signalling

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

node "classroom PC (trainee / instructor)" as pc {
  component "browser\nhttps://<host or LAN IP>\nwindow.isSecureContext = true\ngetUserMedia allowed" as browser
  component "local CA installed once\n(RUNBOOK)" as ca
}

node "SIP phone / softphone" as phone

node "server (docker compose)" as srv {
  component "edge (Caddy)\n:443 TLS, gzip/zstd (¶390)\ncert from infra/scripts/make-certs.sh\n(SANs: localhost, LAN IP, hostname)" as edge
  component "frontend\nVite dev :5173 or built assets" as fe
  component "backend :8100\n/api/*, /api/v1/ws (upgrade)" as be
  component "livekit :7880 signalling\n:7882/udp media" as lk
  component "sip-gateway :5060 udp/tcp (plain)\n:5061 SIP over TLS + SRTP\n(I7 E44, same cert)" as sip
}

browser --> edge : HTTPS / WSS 443
edge --> fe : /  (http, inside compose)
edge --> be : /api, /api/v1/ws
edge --> lk : /rtc -> livekit:7880\n(SIM_LIVEKIT_PUBLIC_URL=wss://<host>)
browser <--> lk : WebRTC media UDP 7882\n(DTLS-SRTP, already encrypted)
phone --> sip : SIP-TLS 5061 / SRTP (SDES)\nor plain SIP 5060 / RTP (Q-I7-E44-1)
ca ..> browser : trusts the edge cert
ca ..> phone : trusts the gateway cert

note right of edge
  First step of E27: pull the Caddy image within
  the time-box its brief sets (slow proxy).
  Fallback if the pull fails (described, built only then):
  - uvicorn --ssl-keyfile / --ssl-certfile on the backend;
  - Vite server.https for the frontend;
  - the backend proxies LiveKit's /rtc WebSocket.
  CORS and Vite allowedHosts updated in both paths.
end note

@enduml
